    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"temporary blip\" is a pretty optimistic take lol. usually when we look at these markets we see that ethnic identity often plays a huge role in how local politics works. are you saying that these tribal tensions don't actually pose a structural risk to things like contract enforcement or supply chain security? i'm trying to understand if the risk is just social or if it actually impacts the institutional reliability.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
